# Command to preset_manager_node (/preset_manager/command).
#   action  "go"      move to the stored preset `name` (planned like every other joint move)
#           "save"    store the arm's CURRENT joint pose under `name` (new or overwrite) in the user file
#           "cancel"  cancel the move in progress (`name` ignored)
string action
string name
---
bool success
string message
